{
    "title": "Blidz - Shop Deals, Earn Money",
    "description": "Looking for a fun and rewarding way to save on your favorite products? Blidz is a social shopping app that makes it easy to shop smart, earn exciting rewards, and score unbeatable deals on everything from clothes shopping to top-tier electronics. Shop, Save & Earn - Have fun!\r\n\r\nBlidz is designed to turn every shopping experience into a game, offering users a chance to earn money through shopping games, group discounts, and special digital coupons.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a cheap deal finder, dollar deal hunter, or looking to save money on your weekly grocery savings, Blidz has something for everyone. Discover the magic of team shopping, share your favorite finds with friends, and unlock a world of rewards and discounts!\r\n\r\nBlidz combines the best features of shop and earn, discounts finder, and shop and save apps, providing you with incredible ways to score the best deals on popular products.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1d TOGETHER, YOU SAVE - BLIDZ TEAM BUY\r\n\r\nBlidz takes team shopping to the next level with group discounts that allow you to shop with friends and score massive savings. Our unique Team Buy feature lets you and your friends enjoy up to 90% off on popular items. \r\n\r\nWhen you spot a great deal, simply select the deal sale/buy option, invite a friend, and together you can grab the ultimate steal deal!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae USER REWARDS AND SHOPPING GAMES\r\n\r\nShopping can be more than just a necessity; it can be fun too! At Blidz, we\u2019ve created a suite of exciting shopping games that let you earn points while you shop. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re trying your luck at treasure hunts or playing shopping games like Candy Cash, you\u2019ll always have a way to boost your earnings while enjoying yourself. \r\n\r\nThese points can be used toward future purchases, making it easier than ever to get the best shopping deals. Every game offers a new opportunity to earn rewards and save on future buys.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 AMAZING DEALS JUST FOR YOU\r\n\r\nBlidz doesn\u2019t stop at regular discounts \u2013 we\u2019re all about bringing you the hottest deal alerts and brand deals. Our platform is the perfect discounts finder for all types of shoppers. \r\n\r\nOur cheap deal finder helps you uncover hidden gems while enjoying a seamless shopping experience. The more you shop, the more you\u2019ll save \u2013 and with Blidz, that\u2019s a promise.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udd93 WHY IS BLIDZ SO AFFORDABLE OR EVEN FREE?\r\n\r\nBlidz is committed to delivering the best shopping experience without the need for costly ads. Instead of investing heavily in marketing, we believe in the power of our users. \r\n\r\nBy sharing Blidz with your friends, you not only help us keep prices low but also unlock even more exclusive deals. It\u2019s a win-win: save money, share your experiences, and enjoy the best discounts around. Our focus on social shopping means you\u2019ll always be in on the hottest deals.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f DOES BLIDZ REALLY HAVE QUALITY PRODUCTS?\r\n\r\nWhether it\u2019s electronics, gadgets, or fashion, our platform offers a curated selection of the latest trending shopping finds. Plus, every item you buy is backed by a 100% secure payment system, a 30-day return policy, and fast customer support.\r\n\r\nSpecial sign-up offer: Every new Blidz user gets a gift worth up to $25.\r\n\r\nCORE FEATURES:\r\n- Free daily rewards\r\n- Millions of available products\r\n- Best price guarantee amongst all online store\r\n- Team-Buy allows you to cash-in on buying with your friends\r\n- Point rewards and fun shopper games\r\n- Personalized product & deal selection\r\n- 100% secure & fully encrypted payments methods: PayPal & all major credit cards\r\n- Fast-delivery and express shipping options\r\n- 30-day guaranteed return policy\r\n- Lightning-fast support\r\n\r\nPRODUCT CATEGORIES:\r\n- Consumer Electronics\r\n- Home goods\r\n- Fashion\r\n- Jewelry\r\n- Accessories\r\n- Outdoor & Sports\r\n- Mother & Kids products\r\n- Beauty products\r\n- Garden and outdoor\r\n- Office supplies\r\n- DIY\r\n- Pet products\r\n\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f Download our social shopping app now and start saving on your favorite products today! Shop and earn money, find the best shopping deals, and have fun with our unique shopping games. With Blidz, every deal is a steal!",
